{"id": "glm_run_length_pack", "signature": "solve(s)", "statement": "Given a string s (possibly empty), return its run-length encoding: each maximal run of the same character is replaced by the character followed by the run length, but the count is omitted entirely when the run length is 1. Runs are encoded in the order they appear.", "tests": [{"args": [""], "expected": ""}, {"args": ["a"], "expected": "a"}, {"args": ["aaabb"], "expected": "a3b2"}, {"args": ["aabcccccaaa"], "expected": "a2bc5a3"}, {"args": ["abcdef"], "expected": "abcdef"}, {"args": ["zzzz"], "expected": "z4"}, {"args": ["aabbccd"], "expected": "a2b2c2d"}, {"args": ["wwwwaaadexxxxxx"], "expected": "w4a3dex6"}, {"args": ["11"], "expected": "12"}, {"args": ["ab"], "expected": "ab"}, {"args": ["qqqqqqqqqqr"], "expected": "q10r"}], "facts": [["arg", "s", "string"], ["iterate", "s"], ["ask", "run_length"], ["run_one", "omit"], ["size", "s", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["run_encode"], "uses": ["run_length_encode"], "solution_sha256": "8c208bde2ff8fcbaa134e10a292d746a29fddb0a2e1f966730eb9515055d4a6f", "reference_sha256": "b13830772f699263d64214147528e74035f9321e6b12d7c346efbf3a6c166d36"}}